{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C4\", \"C3\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C4\", \"C3\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C4\", \"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C3\", \"C1\", \"C2\", \"C4\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C4\", \"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\"],\n  \"why\": \"overall：C1与C2内容完全相同，并列处理；它们保留了v6最重要的心理发展，尤其是从当初不肯再等的理由，到如今连怎样争取都需要重新考虑的变化，综合最稳；C4更有戏剧性，但对理由增多反而加深迟疑这一层交代不足；C3则有些过于概括。keep：C1/C2保留了安宁真实却未实现、当初不肯再等的具体理由、重新投入时对温柔的顾惜，以及理由更多反而更难平静这四层内容；C4明确写出了两条路各有失去的风险，却弱化了最后一层心理变化；C3对两难的交代也不够充分。cover：C4的熟悉亲近忽然变真切、随后想起生活并未回来，以及最后两条路各有失去，最能同时解释B1的骤然惊醒、B5的熟悉感和B3持续盘旋的紧张。lean：C3的心理推进最紧凑，没有反复解释怎样争取才不伤温柔；C1/C2有少量现实未变与怀念无法保护之间的近义重复，但后面的思考仍有递进；C4第三、四条都在讲争取会磨损温柔，重复最明显。plain：C4的生活没回来、不甘心只在心里怀念、再等会失去而争取也会磨损温柔，都比较具体自然；C1/C2的理由更多、怎样争取才不伤温柔稍显概括；C3的威胁仍在、顾虑也不是没道理相对笼统。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5cfb496c-b88d-4a34-9d52-f5f2d57846e4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T005257315764Z", "elapsed_seconds": 83.141, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T00:54:20.462794+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2ca8e9feb6cae94749342e2c62bb1b8cc9e31ab25c7a0228664fbbadf15ba2e0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_p